 "lines": [
  {
   "start": 0.5,
   "end": 6.386,
   "text": "Back across the lake, a man pushed through the crowd. Jairus, a leader of the synagogue.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 6.686,
   "end": 10.987,
   "text": "My little daughter is dying. Please, come and put your hands on her, so she will live.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 11.487,
   "end": 15.587,
   "text": "Jesus went with him. And the crowd pressed in on every side.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 15.887,
   "end": 23.649,
   "text": "In the crowd was a woman who had been bleeding for twelve years. She had spent everything on doctors, and only got worse.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 23.949,
   "end": 26.471,
   "text": "If I just touch his clothes, I will be healed.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 26.871,
   "end": 31.582,
   "text": "She reached out, and touched his robe. Immediately, the bleeding stopped.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 32.382,
   "end": 33.859,
   "text": "Who touched my clothes?",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 34.459,
   "end": 37.925,
   "text": "Trembling, she fell at his feet, and told him everything.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 38.325,
   "end": 41.282,
   "text": "Daughter, your faith has healed you. Go in peace.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 41.982,
   "end": 45.321,
   "text": "Your daughter is dead. Why bother the teacher anymore?",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 45.921,
   "end": 48.096,
   "text": "Don't be afraid. Just believe.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 48.896,
   "end": 55.511,
   "text": "At the house, people were crying and wailing. He said: She is not dead, only asleep. They laughed at him.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 56.011,
   "end": 58.411,
   "text": "He took her by the hand, and said:",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 58.811,
   "end": 62.404,
   "text": "Talitha koum. Little girl, I say to you, get up.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 63.404,
   "end": 67.824,
   "text": "Immediately, she stood up and walked around. She was twelve years old.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 68.724,
   "end": 71.988,
   "text": "Follow for part nine.",
   "tempter": false
  }
 ]
}